@FeatureFlippingApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5078

### Health Check (Always Available)
GET {{FeatureFlippingApi_HostAddress}}/api/health
Accept: application/json

###

### Weather Forecast (Feature Flag: EnableWeatherForecast)
# When enabled: Returns weather forecast data (200 OK)
# When disabled: Returns 503 Service Unavailable
GET {{FeatureFlippingApi_HostAddress}}/api/weather
Accept: application/json

###

### Get All Products (Feature Flag: EnableProductCatalog)
# When enabled: Returns list of products (200 OK)
# When disabled: Returns 503 Service Unavailable
GET {{FeatureFlippingApi_HostAddress}}/api/products
Accept: application/json

###

### Get Product by ID (Feature Flag: EnableProductCatalog)
# When enabled: Returns product details (200 OK) or 404 if not found
# When disabled: Returns 503 Service Unavailable
GET {{FeatureFlippingApi_HostAddress}}/api/products/1
Accept: application/json

###

### Get Product by ID - Not Found (Feature Flag: EnableProductCatalog)
GET {{FeatureFlippingApi_HostAddress}}/api/products/999
Accept: application/json

###
